        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>High Security 1 Inch Mortise Lock Cylinder</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 1\" long mortise lock cylinders are used on any mortise type lock that uses a 1 inch cylinder. Can be used on any mortise box that uses a 1 inch long lock cylinder. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>Also available: Longer <a href=\"/products/high-security-1-1-8-inch-mortise-cylinder-mul-t-lock-206sp-mor1c01\"><b>1-1/8\" Mortise Cylinder</b></a>  , <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/high-security-1-14-inch-mortise-cylinder-mul-t-lock-206sp-mor2c01-xx-1236787\"><b>1-1/4\" Mortise Cylinder</b></a> , and <a href=\"/products/high-security-1-1-2-inch-mortise-lock-cylinder-mul-t-lock-206sp-mor4c01\"><b>1-1/2\" Mortise Cylinder</b></a> for use on impact resistant storefront doors that are 2-1/4\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Supplied standard with 1 owner key card and 2 keys per cylinder. Standard with Adams Rite Cam. Available in 7 different finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Mul-T-Lock 206SP-MOR0C01-xx Mortise Lock Cylinder\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Supplied with Security Ring</li>\r\n<li>Drill and Pick Resistance Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n<li>Adams Rite (A/R) Cam</li>\r\n<li>Standard 1-5/32\" Diameter Lock Housing</li>\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>MUL-T-LOCK's cylindrical locks are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Saves time and money on future lock replacements or re-keying when employees leave.  Remove the worry about anyone making duplicates of your keys. <b>Keep your store doors safe!</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf ordering multiple locks you can have them Key Alike (use the same key) or Keyed Different (different keys for each lock). You can also order <a href=\"/products/cut-keys-for-mul-t-lock-locksets-and-padlocks\">Extra Keys Cut</a> below if more than 2 are required.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "High Security 1 Inch Mortise Cylinder, Mul-T-Lock 206SP-MOR0C01-xx",
                "description": "Mul-T-Lock High 206SP-MOR0C01 Security Grade 1 restricted key locks. These 1 inch long mortise lock cylinders are used on aluminum frame store entry doors. Can be used on any mortise box that uses a 1 inch lock cylinder. Supplied standard with 1 owner key card and 2 keys per cylinder. Standard with Adams Rite Cam. Available in 7 different finish colors.",
                "keywords": "MTL-206SP-MOR0C01-xx High Security 1-inch Mortise Cylinders, Mul-T-Lock 206S-MOR0C01-xx Mortise Cylinders, Mul-T-Lock 206S-MOR0C01-26 mortise locks, MTL-206S-MOR0C01-26 Security Store Door Locks, 1 inch mortise locks, Bump Proof locks, 1 Inch Mortise locks, store door mortise locks,"
            },
